    {
      "id": "bailu-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "白露是第十五个节气。太阳到达黄经165°，清晨的露水变白了。",
        "en": "Bailu is the fifteenth term: the Sun reaches 165°. Morning dew turns white."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-bailu-feature",
        "source-xinhua-bailu-2022"
      ],
