      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "bailu-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "白露是农历八月的\"节\"。温度下降，水汽凝成可见的露珠。",
        "en": "Bailu is the node term of the eighth lunar month. Falling temperatures turn vapor into visible dew."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（传统历法编算规则）"
      ],
      "period": "现行农历编算口径；GB/T 33661-2017 为现行国家标准（正文条款待人工核读）",
      "source_ids": [
